    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player's slime is weak at the start and starts at the bottom of the standings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The number of wins and losses in each season will move you up or down in the rankings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the season is over, you'll start practicing and increasing the stats of your slimes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a slime that gradually becomes stronger, and you will move up the rankings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal of the game is to become the champion in five seasons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck!\uff01</p>",
